msgid "1 m FICSIT wall, 0.5 m thick, like the game's 1 m FICSIT wall. Aim at a road to follow its edge (centred on the edge), or at an intersection to follow its curb; aim at the upper or lower half of a fence wall to stack another above or below it (1 m and 4 m walls stack together). Can be painted; the customizer's Material tab switches between concrete and FICSIT. Costs what the 4 m wall does. Cost is per 4 m."
msgstr ""
